  src/tracking/zone-geometry.js                          ← openfollow/zones/geometry.py
  src/tracking/zone-engine.js                            ← openfollow/zones/engine.py, docs/architecture/zones.md
  tools/tracking-detect/bytetrack.py                     ← openfollow/video/tracking.py
  tools/tracking-detect/detector.py                      ← openfollow/video/detection.py
  src/tracking/detect-pin.js                             ← openfollow/runtime/services_detection_pin.py,
                                                            openfollow/runtime/frame_timing.py,
                                                            openfollow/video/detection.py (tracked_detection)
